      "value": "<p>&gt;@UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.class-features.Item.rpaon3jF3nCe5eP9]{Theorem (Ex)}</p>\n<p>You can craft food or drink in half the time it would normally take, your custom microlab counts as professional’s tools for Profession (cook) checks, and you can use your Life Science skill in place of Profession (cook) for checks other than those to earn a living. If you gain an insight bonus to Life Science or Profession (cook) checks, you apply that insight bonus to both skills.</p>"
